    {
      "id": "logo-note",
      "page": "logo",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": -980,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Jericho rejected all four earlier directions (below) on 2026-08-20 \u2014 the new brief is TWO PEOPLE READING A BIBLE.\n\nEight takes on that one idea. Use the surface switch to check each on paper, on blue and in one colour.\n\nPick a drawing here, then it gets refined into the real kit: lockups, clear space, app icon, favicon.\n\nThe four below are kept only as history."
    },
    {
      "id": "calendar-note",
      "page": "screens",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 560,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Calendar is v1; the Google Calendar push is v1.1 (decision 45).\n\nWeek opens by default and the week starts SUNDAY (46). Every state is on screen: a past-due proposed meeting asking to be confirmed (52), a held one, a cancelled one struck through (50), and two groups at the same hour splitting the column (58).\n\nNAV SETTLED (62): People and Groups are now one tab called People, with a segmented control inside. Tab bar = Home \u00b7 Calendar \u00b7 [+] \u00b7 People \u00b7 Reports."
    }
